    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as a hunted cyborg, seeking your purpose, climbing up from the mysterious facility, and uncovering the secrets beneath (and above) the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first-person action game, you can parkour through a delicate environment built by the Unreal 5 Engine and fight against other evil machines with the assistance of a mysterious voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Climbing, dashing, wall-running, grappling, throwing, reflecting enemy projectiles, breaking through obstacles, and using the environment to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destroy enemies and use their abilities! Control drones to move around, or grab missiles and use them to rocket jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Search for additional upgrades and customize your way through the enemy lines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as a hunted cyborg, seeking your purpose, climbing up from the mysterious facility, and uncovering the secrets beneath (and above) the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first-person action game, you can parkour through a delicate environment built by the Unreal 5 Engine and fight against other evil machines with the assistance of a mysterious voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Climbing, dashing, wall-running, grappling, throwing, reflecting enemy projectiles, breaking through obstacles, and using the environment to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destroy enemies and use their abilities! Control drones to move around, or grab missiles and use them to rocket jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Search for additional upgrades and customize your way through the enemy lines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "XELVITA is a first-person action game\u2014Experience fast-paced first-person action as a hunted cyborg, traverse enemy lines in an abandoned sci-fi facility, and team up with an unknown intelligence to fight against the mechanical threat.",
